  {
    "expand": "renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations",
    "id": "10529",
    "self": "https://simeoncalixte1990.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10529",
    "key": "AIN-206",
    "fields": {
      "summary": "Repair pipeline package test typechecks and standardize static-check scripts",
      "description": {
        "type": "doc",
        "version": 1,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Discovered while verifying AIN-205. Shared and SchemaGeneration full test-inclusive tsc failures match the untouched source baseline exactly (missing cross-package test imports and pre-existing test typing errors). Source builds pass. Shared/Normalization/RiskCompute/SchemaGeneration lack package-wide ESLint/Prettier scripts. Feedback lacks static-check scripts beyond syntax build. These gaps prevent a blanket merge-readiness claim; they are not regressions introduced by canonical removal."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Acceptance: repair missing test dependency/module references and test typing errors without disabling tests; add documented typecheck, ESLint and Prettier scripts appropriate to each package; run full checks and affected tests on clean registry dependency installs; preserve behavior and attach before/after check logs. Coordinate with AIN-55 CI-contract ownership; do not close AIN-55/47 on this narrower task. Backend/tooling only; no new UI workflow. Evidence on AIN-205 and output/remove-canonical-2026-11-14/{shared-typecheck-gap,schema-typecheck-gap}.log."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
